Package: cockpit-shares
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: François Rousselet <7969502+frousselet@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: cockpit-bridge
Recommends: cockpit-ws, samba, samba-common-bin
Suggests: wsdd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/frousselet/cockpit-shares
Description: Cockpit page to manage file shares (SMB/Samba)
 Create and manage SMB shares, every smb.conf parameter, Samba users,
 connected clients and the Samba services from the Cockpit web console.
 .
 Every change is validated by testparm before it is written, and the
 previous versions of smb.conf are kept so that they can be restored.
